Package: foundryR
Title: Tidy Interface to 'Azure AI Foundry'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Farach", , "alexfarach@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides a tidy, application programming interface (API)-first
    interface to 'Microsoft Azure AI Foundry'. All functions return tibbles and
    integrate with 'tidyverse' and 'tidymodels' workflows. Supports chat
    completions, responses, audio transcription, image generation, file and
    batch operations, text embeddings, and semantic similarity using
    Azure-hosted models including 'GPT', 'Claude', 'Llama', 'Mistral',
    'DeepSeek', and 'Cohere'.
